  FP[speed]: 'Massively Hypersonic+ (Oryx is one of the faster enemies, who fought with the the Guardian. The latter was able to react to lightning during their Stormcaller training.Shard of the Traveler (Stormcaller) Should be superior to the The Stormherd, who can hook lightning from the air mid-descentCloudstrike) | At least Massively Hypersonic+ (At least as fast as in material space)'
  FP[range]: "Several Meters melee range, up to at least Interplanetary (Oryx was able to Take targets and spread the Taken Blight across the Sol System.The Coming War | Fleetbase Korus | The Taken KingThe Taken War: Venus | Entropy's Pinnacle | The Taken KingThe Taken War: Mars His Eversion Anchors can reach across the Sol system.Echoed Warnings | Skyburner's Deep-Scan Data | Heresy After becoming the Taken King, Oryx launched a counter attack across the spinward frontier against the Ecumene, who are a galactic civilizationThe Navigator) and Interdimensional (Can tear and reach into the Ascendant Plane) | At least Multiversal (The power and influence of the Hive Gods extends across the Ascendant Plane), Extradimensional (Can reach outside of the Ascendant Plane, such as into material space, Vex space or even deep into Darkness)"
  FP[intelligence]: 'Supergenius (Oryx is the Hive God of navigation and it is in his nature to try and understand everything, a nature he has been living up to for billions of years. He knows the secrets of the universe. Oryx took the knowledge of Akka to travel into the Darkness itself, a feat few beings in existence are capable of. From his communion with the Darkness he learned and wrote down how to Take.The Lightblade | Memory of Ruin | Witch Queen Taking is an ontological weapon that allows one to reform matter in a self-contained reality where the creator controls past, present and future, and it involves conducting a mathematical operation on the target. Oryx can wage war against Xivu Arath, who is the God of War, and engage in a battle of wits with Savathûn, who is the God of Cunning, though he does not surpass his sisters in these areas. Is one of the three founding members of the Hive and the most knowledgeable alongside Savathûn.Rites of the Deep | Sloane: "We Still Have to Deal With Oryx\'s Sisters" | Heresy Even some lesser Wizards hold knowledge that is completely incomprehensible for Ghosts. Lesser Hive are also capable of constructing an intergalactic library that holds so much information it has broken the Bekenstein limit.Destiny: The World\'s Grave (mission) Even basic Hive technology is indistinguishable from magic to futuristic civilizationsShredder), Nigh-Omniscient within his Throne World (Oryx\'s throne world, which is an entire universe of its own, is indistinguishable from his own mind, allowing him to be aware of practically everything that transpires within itThe Ritual | Threadweaver | Witch QueenThe Final Days | The Illusion | The Final Shape)'
  FP[tier]: "At least 6-A, 4-B Environmental Destruction through the destruction of the Dreadnaught's core | At least Low 2-C, likely 2-C"
